deo_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "PDF Reader", "keywords": ["PDF", "reader", "document", "office", "bave"], "long_description": "**Mixed reality real-scale PDF Viewer (with passthrough)**\n\nView yor PDF documents (A4-A0) in actual size using mixed reality passthrough. Ideal for architects, engineers, and creatives that wants to reduce printings and save paper. Supports for controllers, hand tracking, and Logitech MX Ink Stylus.\n\n**Getting Started:**\n\n1.  **Load PDFs:** Use the headset browser, PC USB transfer, connect a USB drive storage, or try the new cloud transfer (currently in closed beta).\n2.  **Open Files:** Use the left-hand menu/icon or grab the yellow sheet.\n3.  **Annotate:** View, draw & save ink comments on PDFs (free preview module). Enhanced with pressure-sensitive MX Ink.\n\n**Compatibility & Features:**\n\n-   **Reads:** Standard PDF, signed .P7M,\n- **Reads:** Comic books in CBR/.CBZ (free beta preview)\n- **PDF Annotaions**: View, draw and save INK annotations\n-   **Kiosk Mode:** Showcase specific files locking the app functionalities (free preview)\n-   **Add-ons:** Expand features like multi-file viewing (sold separately).\n- **USB OTG Storage**: Read the files from a connected USB storage device\n- **Cloud transfer**:  upload PDF from a webpage (free closed beta) \n\n**Important Info:**\n-   **Limitations:** No encrypted, password, or FileOpen DRM PDFs\n-   **Privacy First:** Files stay local. No cloud processing, no account needed.\n-   **Permissions:** Grant file access on first launch (use settings button if missed).\n- **Kiosk mode** To exit the kiosk mode, click the controller thumbstiks.\n-   **Development:** App is evolving, feedback welcome!\n-   **Support:** Issues? Contact www.bave.info.", "short_description": "Simple and fast PDF, P7M documents viewer with annotations. Free base usage with premium add-ons."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.bave.info/privacynotice", "develope